            "Frank-Starling"
          ],
          "source_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/16rtI7UNn7_Nzr7FcTUXYvxoimQx35b5x/view?usp=drivesdk"
        },
        {
          "id": "16rtI7UNn7_Nzr7FcTUXYvxoimQx35b5x-c10",
          "front": "How does exercise raise cardiac output through preload?",
          "back": "Muscle pump + sympathetic venoconstriction increase venous return and EDV → ↑SV.",
